        <item>
            <title>0.10.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 23:31:43 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>186</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.10.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Supply 0.10.0</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Per-clip looks</b> — give an individual clip its own LUT stack (e.g. one clip black-and-white while the rest of the wedding stays colour). The whole-session look stays the default; switch scope in the Look section.</li>
  <li><b>Light / Dark / System appearance</b> — pick your theme in Settings. The app now opens in Dark by default.</li>
  <li><b>Redesigned Inspector</b> — cleaner Premiere/Lightroom-style sections and consistent, tidier action buttons.</li>
  <li><b>Reframe &amp; viewer modes</b> — Esc now reliably exits any viewer tool, with an on-screen badge showing the active mode.</li>
  <li><b>Undo survives look changes</b> — trying a different LUT no longer wipes your grading undo history.</li>
  <li><b>Easier importing</b> — a + button and right-click “Import Clips…” in the clip list, and the window opens at a more usable size.</li>
  <li>Fixes: LUT names now display correctly after reopening a session, plus assorted polish.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
